# Credentials for stage 2 extract. Pick one:
#  - `ant auth login` (OAuth profile in ~/.config/anthropic/): leave ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#    commented out. Even an empty value here overrides the profile.
#  - A Console API key: uncomment and set it.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional: model for stage 2 extract (default claude-haiku-5-5)
# EXTRACT_MODEL=
# Optional: database path (default jobs.db)
# JOBS_DB=
